---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Contatti Impermeabilizzazioni Genova e Liguria | Poliurea"
    description="Contatta Poliurea System telefonicamente (Luigi o Alessandro) o via email a info@poliureasystem.it per sopralluoghi gratuiti a Genova e in Liguria."
    activePath="/contatti"
    breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Contatti', path: '/contatti' }]}
>
    <PageIntro
        eyebrow="CONTATTI DIRETTI & SUPPORTO"
        title="Infiltrazioni in corso?"
        highlight="Parla con un tecnico."
        text="Che si tratti di un'infiltrazione attiva da bloccare con urgenza o di un preventivo per ristrutturare un terrazzo senza demolizioni, siamo a tua disposizione per un riscontro rapido e professionale."
    />

    <section class="contact-page wrap my-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] items-center">
        <!-- Colonna Sinistra: Modulo Guidato -->
        <div class="contact-panel rounded-[28px] border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-[#F5F5F7] p-8 sm:p-10 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
            <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] mb-2">MODULO GUIDATO IN 1 MINUTO</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">Richiedi il sopralluogo<br /><span class="text-[#0071E3]">diagnostico gratuito.</span></h2>
            <p class="text-[#6E6E73] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">Il modo più rapido e preciso per iniziare. Il modulo guidato raccoglie le informazioni essenziali, ti permette di allegare foto del problema e inoltra la richiesta al nostro ufficio tecnico per una presa in carico immediata.</p>
            <a class="button button-primary inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0064CC] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white transition-colors duration-200 w-full focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0071E3]" href="/preventivo">
                Avvia la richiesta guidata <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-base font-bold">↗</span>
            </a>
            <div class="contact-assurance mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F]">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#30A14E] text-white text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span> Sopralluogo diagnostico senza impegno</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#30A14E] text-white text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span> Risposta garantita entro 24 ore</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Colonna Destra: Recapiti Diretti -->
        <aside class="contact-details rounded-[28px] border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-[#F5F5F7] p-6 sm:p-10 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
            <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] mb-2">CANALI DIRETTI AZIENDALI</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">Contattaci direttamente<br />per urgenze e chiarimenti.</h2>
            <p class="text-[#6E6E73] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Siamo operativi per sopralluoghi tecnici in Liguria e regioni limitrofe. Per un contatto telefonico immediato o per l'invio di capitolati e documentazione:</p>
            
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0071E3] text-white">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                        <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6E6E73]">TELEFONO DIRETTO · LUIGI</small>
                        <a href="tel:+393441366523" class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-bold hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors break-words">+39 344 136 6523</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0071E3] text-white">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                        <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6E6E73]">TELEFONO DIRETTO · ALESSANDRO</small>
                        <a href="tel:+393484052908" class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-bold hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors break-words">+39 348 405 2908</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0071E3] text-white">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2" /><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                        <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6E6E73]">EMAIL INFORMAZIONI & CAPITOLATI</small>
                        <a href="mailto:info@poliureasystem.it" class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-bold hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors break-words">info@poliureasystem.it</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="contact-placeholder flex items-start sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3]">
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#0071E3] text-white">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm">
                        <small class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6E6E73]">SEDE OPERATIVA & RAGGIO D'INTERVENTO</small>
                        <strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-bold block break-words">Genova / Liguria e regioni limitrofe</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- BANNER METODO -->
    <section class="contact-bottom py-14 bg-[#F5F5F7] border-y border-[#D2D2D7]">
        <div class="wrap contact-bottom-inner flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] mb-1">VUOI CAPIRE COME OPERIAMO?</p>
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#1D1D1F]">Le nostre 3 modalità operative:<br /><span class="text-[#0071E3]">manuale, poliurea a caldo a spruzzo e bituminoso armato Remat.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <a class="text-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#0071E3] hover:text-[#0064CC] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0071E3] rounded p-1" href="/metodo">
                Scopri i 3 metodi <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
